{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:02:20.888691Z","id":"771208c5bda950dac2d8d1c4822cdc9ad7ed45112cc1341fef029df463fb331c","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:900e6485","summary":"The budget is 64069 in web/perf/bundle-budget.json. Evidence: npm run build && node scripts/bundle-size.mjs exits 0 with 'artifact 64069' after 55443491.","supersedes":"4ba1bef88ebee53d292310430277264c9ef9869541a73a5d4f6f351041abf6c7","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:02:11.815194Z","id":"5ad3c5f8ab05006d60be365677ee7556e17b42a353875e335a37319751a4fcd0","body":{"detail":"The panel embeds the shell's Sidebar, ThreadCard and SendButton; the owner chip, the withheld label and the Send menu's grouping brought it to 65396 gzip bytes (from 65043), with the menu and the approval card moved into lazy chunks. The extension's own Send menu names (plan Task 23) have almost no room.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":15},"end":{"line":15},"content_hash":"935c259722638f24eea9dd631ad2e5f8cc1da6109229199e3b748da29265c76f"},"summary":"The extension panel is 140 bytes under its 65536 ceiling","tags":["task:23","bundle","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
